RedAlert Project X

Built on OpenRA and Command & Conquer: Red Alert.

3D models

These Sketchfab models were rendered into the unit sprites. Changes for
every model: recoloured for team colours, rendered as game sprites from
32 directions; parts that hid the unit from above were removed.

